          "heading": "Emmanuel Iyogun embraces front-row conversion after making his senior England debut",
          "body": "Northampton prop Emmanuel Iyogun has opened up about his transition from a reluctant teenage number eight to England's newest front-row option. After making his senior international debut off the bench against Argentina in July, the Spain-born forward admitted his early scrummaging experiences were far from smooth. Initially teased by teammates for running away from rucks, Iyogun persevered to earn Steve Borthwick's trust, demonstrating the raw resilience that has defined his unlikely rise to the senior Test squad."
