          "heading": "Peter O'Mahony admits Rassie Erasmus's Munster departure 'hurt' him deeply",
          "body": "Ireland legend Peter O'Mahony has opened up about the emotional toll of Rassie Erasmus's departure from Munster in 2017. Speaking on the Indo Sport podcast to promote his new book, All In, the veteran flanker confessed he felt personally aggrieved when the director of rugby returned to South Africa. \"I was hurt because I trusted him and I was all into his game plan, and I was driving that for him,\" O'Mahony revealed. Despite the initial sting, he conceded the move made business sense."
