          "heading": "Josh Adams confirms fitness for November tests while targeting third World Cup",
          "body": "Wales wing Josh Adams expects to be fit for the upcoming Nations Championship fixtures after missing the summer tour of South Africa with a calf injury. The 31-year-old, who has 72 caps, has returned to training with Cardiff and anticipates a club comeback later this month. With one year until the 2027 World Cup opener against Zimbabwe in Adelaide, Adams is determined to secure a spot in Australia, stating: \"I'm desperate to go, but there is loads of rugby to be played.\""
