          "heading": "Hunter Paisami misses All Blacks Tests as Bledisloe Cup appeal fails",
          "body": "Wallabies centre Hunter Paisami will miss the upcoming Bledisloe Cup series against New Zealand after failing to overturn a four-week suspension. The 28-year-old appealed an initial six-match ban for a dangerous tackle on South Africa’s Sacha Feinberg-Mngomezulu during the 42-38 victory in Perth. While the SANZAAR committee applied a two-week reduction for his remorse and conduct, the final sanction excludes him from the Tests in Auckland and Sydney. Les Kiss has called up Queensland Reds full-back Jock Campbell to replace the midfielder."
